        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Lionheart, Khiladiyon Ka Khiladi\n- People: Sheldon Lettich, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Brian Thompson, Harrison Page, Deborah Rennard, Lisa Pelikan, Ashley Johnson\n- Topics: film aliases, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Claude Van Damme was born on 18 October 1960 as Jean-Claude Camille François Van Varenberg.\n- Jean-Claude Van Damme is a Belgian actor, martial artist, screenwriter, film producer, and director known for martial arts action films.\n- Lionheart is a 1990 action film directed by Sheldon Lettich.\n- Lionheart stars Jean-Claude Van Damme and co-stars Brian Thompson, Harrison Page, Deborah Rennard, Lisa Pelikan, and Ashley Johnson.\n- Lionheart is also known as Wrong Bet, A.W.O.L.: Absent Without Leave, Leon, and Full Contact.\n- Khiladiyon Ka Khiladi is loosely based on the Hollywood film Lionheart.",
